Package: evidr
Title: Review R Code Changes with Evidence and an Audit Trail
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ndoh", "Penn", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A local 'shiny' app in the spirit of 'testthat::snapshot_review()'.
    A reviewer sees what an AI-drafted script changes in the code and in the
    output, compares it with an independently written implementation, and
    accepts, edits or rejects it. Each step is written to a hash-chained audit
    trail with 'regulog'. Replays recompute fingerprints of code, data,
    environment and output, and mark an earlier review stale when any of them
    changed.
URL: https://github.com/repro-stats/evidr
BugReports: https://github.com/repro-stats/evidr/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny (>= 1.7.0), bslib (>= 0.5.0), htmltools, digest, callr, regulog, reproducr, utils, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), survival
Config/testthat/edition: 3
